  "privacyBody": "КроссСлов does not require registration and does not request your name, telephone number, email address or other personal data to use the game.\n\nGame progress, words found in an unfinished level, crystal balance, statistics, achievements, Endless game state, settings and the selected theme are stored locally on the user's device. Cloud synchronization of game data is not used.\n\nThe application does not transmit game progress to the developer and does not use it to identify the user. Local game data can be deleted using the operating system's tools by clearing the application's data or uninstalling the application from the device.\n\nWhen contacting the developer by email or Telegram, the user voluntarily provides data to the selected communication service. Such data is processed in accordance with the rules of that service.\n\n",
  "termsBody": "КроссСлов is a word game. By using the application, the user agrees to the terms of this End User License Agreement.\n\nThe game is provided for personal, non-commercial use. The user may play through the campaign, solve crosswords, use hints, earn achievements and, after completing the campaign, continue playing in Endless mode.\n\nCrystals are exclusively an in-game resource. They may be awarded for actions in the game and spent on functions provided by the game. Crystals are not money, have no monetary value and cannot be exchanged for money.\n\nGame progress and settings are stored locally on the device. The user is responsible for safeguarding the data on their device. Local game data may be lost if the application is uninstalled, its data is cleared, the device is reset or in other circumstances.\n\nThe developer may release updates, fix errors and change the game's balance, content, appearance and functionality. Updates may differ from previous versions of the game.\n\nThe application is provided \"as is\". The developer strives to ensure that the game works correctly but does not guarantee the absence of software errors or compatibility with all devices and operating system versions.\n\nThe user must not attempt to interfere with the operation of the application, distribute modified versions of the application on behalf of the developer or use the game's materials in violation of applicable law or the rights of rights holders.\n\n"
